  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ZAATARI COOKBOOK - GOOSE LANE EDITIONS ICMPS 2023- 200 COPIES</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This follows our support to Karen Fischer and the Zaatari Cookbook initiative in 2021-22, in which the partner worked with Syrian women at Zaatari Refugee Camp in Northern Jordan, to create a cookbook preserving the Syrian cuisine and cultural heritage of the families in the camp. the international sale of the book is also contributing to female economic empowerment, because all of the proceeds are returned to the women of the camp. In this respect, the embassy purchased 200 cookbooks, to support the project, and for future use at the Embassy to highlight the initiative and raise awareness about the women of Zaatari Camp.</narrative>
  </description>
